{"id":"n71730-1-7","stage":1,"title":"차갑다 · 凉","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71730-1-7-1","ko":"와서 수박 먹어.","zh":"过来吃西瓜吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"수박","meaning":"西瓜","explanation":"수박：西瓜","readings":[{"term":"수박","audio":"/audio/9375b0dc54036ec53a6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29555","senseId":"1","lemma":"수박","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수박","audio":"/audio/9375b0dc54036ec53a6f.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어","audio":"/audio/65922367ccfa237c5c51.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"9375b0dc54036ec5","term":"수박","zh":"西瓜","audio":"/audio/9375b0dc54036ec53a6f.mp3","entryId":"29555","definition":"一种又圆又大的水果，果皮呈绿色，并有蓝黑色条纹，果肉呈红色，且多汁。","pronunciation":["수ː박"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1bd4e02280ea2c22f92.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71730-1-7-2","ko":"수박이 별로 차갑지가 않네요. 냉장고에 안 넣어 놨어요?","zh":"这西瓜不太凉啊。没放冰箱里吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"수박이","meaning":"西瓜","explanation":"수박：西瓜；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수박","audio":"/audio/9375b0dc54036ec53a6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29555","senseId":"1","lemma":"수박","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수박이","audio":"/audio/7f0e476133d319f66cf4.mp3"}},{"text":"별로","meaning":"（不）怎么，（不）太","explanation":"별로 在本句与后面的 안、없다、-지 않다 等否定表达合用，合起来表示“不怎么、不太”。否定意义需要和后文一起理解。","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}},{"text":"차갑지가","meaning":"凉，冰凉","explanation":"차갑다：凉，冰凉；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；가：附在名词化表达等后加强强调，如 먹지를 못하다（怎么也吃不下）。","readings":[{"term":"차갑다","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71730","senseId":"1","lemma":"차갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차갑지가","audio":"/audio/b8abeca915d23c6254e1.mp3"}},{"text":"않네요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않네요","audio":"/audio/042cabd29a00026f1220.mp3"}},{"text":"냉장고에","meaning":"冰箱","explanation":"냉장고：冰箱；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"냉장고","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31524","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉장고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉장고에","audio":"/audio/5908e5f7eb6dd820ecf9.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"넣어","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넣어","audio":"/audio/5917140fe7e2cfbda3f8.mp3"}},{"text":"놨어요?","meaning":"放，放置","explanation":"놓다：放，放置；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"9","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놨어요","audio":"/audio/9f99e1df49c84afbce0a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9375b0dc54036ec5","term":"수박","zh":"西瓜","audio":"/audio/9375b0dc54036ec53a6f.mp3","entryId":"29555","definition":"一种又圆又大的水果，果皮呈绿色，并有蓝黑色条纹，果肉呈红色，且多汁。","pronunciation":["수ː박"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"（不）怎么，（不）太","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"（不）怎么，（不）太","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"489db26a6bdebee8","term":"차갑다","zh":"凉，冰凉","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3","entryId":"71730","definition":"皮肤接触到的感觉很凉。","pronunciation":["차갑따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"b3bf31f65841d3e1","term":"냉장고","zh":"冰箱","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3","entryId":"31524","definition":"为避免食物坏掉或为了冷却而在低温中进行保管的箱式机器。","pronunciation":["냉ː장고"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"放，放置","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"把原本手里抓或握着的物体置于某处。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7ad793988e2b4f2af16.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.33,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71730","label":"国立国语院